---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy" description="Privacy — files never leave your device. No upload, no tracking.">
<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
<h1 class="text-3xl font-black">Privacy</h1>
<p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">All-in-One Helper is private by design. Your files never leave your device. There is no <code>/upload</code> endpoint. Processing happens in your browser via WebAssembly and Canvas. You can verify in DevTools → Network: 0 bytes uploaded.</p>
<h2 class="mt-8 font-bold">What we collect</h2>
<ul class="mt-2 list-disc list-inside text-sm text-slate-600 space-y-1">
<li>Cloudflare Web Analytics — aggregated, anonymized pageviews, no cookies, no fingerprinting.</li>
<li>Google AdSense (if ads show) — Google may use cookies per their policy. Opt out at myadcenter.google.com.</li>
<li>Buy Me a Coffee button — loads from cdnjs, no tracking beyond BMC.</li>
<li>localStorage for preferences (dark mode) — stays on your device.</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="mt-6 font-bold">What we don't collect</h2>
<p class="text-sm text-slate-600">We don't collect your files, file names, or contents. No login, no email, no cross-site tracking.</p>
<p class="mt-6 text-xs text-slate-500">Contact: via <a href="https://www.buymeacoffee.com/contactae2b" class="underline">BMC</a> or GitHub issues.</p>
</div>
</Layout>
